{
  "_about": "UniSkilled's agreed terminology. Every translation (human or AI) must use these terms. Status 'draft' = proposed, waiting for the reviewer named in locales/review.json. Change a term here first, then in the dictionaries; tests/i18n_checks.mjs checks the dictionaries use these terms.",
